Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那边那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么？快住手？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做什么？
