Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点 听懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
